    "Actual approved FD -> encrypted immutable Node chunks -> browser ReadableStream -> signed verified upload; stable native and core operation IDs",
    "Authenticated bounded binary PUT, durable block checkpoints, identical retry and differing-prefix rejection; no JSON file body",
    "Independent principal/browser -> actual peer relay -> root and SHA verified native output; no overwrite; foreign room/job/input and private native aliases rejected",
    "Principal/room/creating-scope bound byte GET, exact real bytes, bounded ranges, release and foreign-token denial",
    "Locally bound exact password never enters tool JSON/export; locked names stay redacted to reader, canonical ciphertext root verifies across different chunk dimensions, authorized plaintext bytes match, unauthorized plaintext requires input and publishes no file",
